.cache/
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Claude
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
TECHNICAL_DECISIONS.md
*REFACTORING*.md

# internal
src/__generated__
# scratch projects of the "generated ReScript compiles" tests (removed after each run)
.rescript-compile-check/
.rescript-pilot-check/
# Real production specs (proprietary, local-only — golden tests read them)
openapi.json
openapi-core.json

# Golden snapshots of the proprietary specs are a full transformed copy of the
# business contract — local-only, never committed. Regenerate with:
# node scripts/update-golden.mjs
src/tests/golden/*
# The synthetic spec is ours and carries no business data — its goldens are
# committed, and they are the only byte-level regression guard CI can run.
!src/tests/golden/kitchen-sink.*
